{
  "tema": 5226,
  "slug": "tuve-tuvo",
  "titulo": "Tener in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Ayer tuve clase de jiu-jitsu.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Tener is irregular in the preterite: its stem becomes tuv- and it takes endings without accents: tuve, tuviste, tuvo, tuvimos, tuvieron.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In the preterite, **tener** changes its stem to **tuv-** and uses a special set of endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "tuv-",
            "+",
            "-e, -iste, -o, -imos, -ieron"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "tener"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "tuve"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "tuviste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "tuvo"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros / nosotras",
              "tuvimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "tuvieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**No written accents**: **tuve**, **tuvo** (compare regular **comí**, **comió**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs built on tener do the same: **mantener → mantuve**, **obtener → obtuve**, **detener → detuvo**, **contener → contuvo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Tuve que** + infinitive = _I had to_ (and did it): **Tuve que trabajar.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **estar** works the same way (**estuve**, **estuvo**). Learn the **-uv-** pair together."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Ayer ==tuve== clase de jiu-jitsu a las siete.",
              "en": "Yesterday I had jiu-jitsu class at seven."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Tuviste== problemas en la garita?",
              "en": "Did you have problems at the border crossing?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi hermana ==tuvo== un bebé en mayo.",
              "en": "My sister had a baby in May."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Tuvimos== que esperar dos horas para cruzar.",
              "en": "We had to wait two hours to cross."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los vecinos ==tuvieron== una cosecha enorme de chiles este año.",
              "en": "The neighbors had a huge chili harvest this year."
            },
            {
              "es": "La Rocinante ==tuvo== que aterrizar en Ganímedes.",
              "en": "The Rocinante had to land on Ganymede."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==tuvieron== suerte con las olas hoy.",
              "en": "You all got lucky with the waves today."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Obtuve== mi cinta azul el año pasado.",
              "en": "I got my blue belt last year."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
